      "text": "1. Short long URL to a short URL\n    - Support custom URL\n    - Expiration date\n2. Redirect short URL to long URL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Short long URL to a short URL\n    - Support custom URL\n    - Expiration date\n2. Redirect short URL to long URL",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
