      "index": "b0l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1048,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2048,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep Dives:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep Dives:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1394,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1049,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2049,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Unique short codes: counter + base62\n   - Redis INCR = global ID that never repeats\n   - Each Write Service reserves 1000 IDs at once\n     (INCRBY 1000), hands them out via AtomicLong\n     -> 1 Redis call per 1000 writes\n   - Scramble ID (id x prime mod 62^7), then base62,\n     so codes are not sequential / guessable\n   - Instance crash loses a block -> a gap, still unique",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Unique short codes: counter + base62\n   - Redis INCR = global ID that never repeats\n   - Each Write Service reserves 1000 IDs at once\n     (INCRBY 1000), hands them out via AtomicLong\n     -> 1 Redis call per 1000 writes\n   - Scramble ID (id x prime mod 62^7), then base62,\n     so codes are not sequential / guessable\n   - Instance crash loses a block -> a gap, still unique",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1050,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2050,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Custom alias\n   - Same table; PK unique constraint is the referee\n   - INSERT conflict -> 409 Conflict\n   - Generated code hits a taken alias -> next ID",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Custom alias\n   - Same table; PK unique constraint is the referee\n   - INSERT conflict -> 409 Conflict\n   - Generated code hits a taken alias -> next ID",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1765,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1051,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2051,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Expiration\n   - Read path: expires_at < now -> 410, no redirect\n   - Cron deletes expired rows in batches (index)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Expiration\n   - Read path: expires_at < now -> 410, no redirect\n   - Cron deletes expired rows in batches (index)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -350,
      "y": 1875,
      "width": 530,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1052,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Concurrency hot spots (for the Java build)\n   - ID block refill: many threads, one refill (lock)\n   - Two requests, same alias: putIfAbsent, one wins\n   - In-memory LRU cache shared by request threads",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Concurrency hot spots (for the Java build)\n   - ID block refill: many threads, one refill (lock)\n   - Two requests, same alias: putIfAbsent, one wins\n   - In-memory LRU cache shared by request threads",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1394,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1053,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. Low-latency redirects (< 200 ms)\n   - Cache-aside Redis: hit ~1 ms, miss -> replica\n   - 80/20: a small cache serves most clicks\n   - Cache TTL = min(24h, expires_at - now)\n   - Write Service also puts new links in the cache,\n     so a fresh link works before the replica\n     catches up",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Low-latency redirects (< 200 ms)\n   - Cache-aside Redis: hit ~1 ms, miss -> replica\n   - 80/20: a small cache serves most clicks\n   - Cache TTL = min(24h, expires_at - now)\n   - Write Service also puts new links in the cache,\n     so a fresh link works before the replica\n     catches up",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1054,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. 302, not 301\n   - 301 is cached by the browser forever, so\n     expiry and click analytics would break\n   - 302 sends every click back through us",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. 302, not 301\n   - 301 is cached by the browser forever, so\n     expiry and click analytics would break\n   - 302 sends every click back through us",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deep-7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1735,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1055,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791710000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. Scale + availability (AP)\n   - Reads >> writes: scale Read/Write separately\n   - 500 GB fits one Postgres primary + replicas\n   - Outgrow it? shard by hash(short_code), or a\n     KV store (DynamoDB): every lookup is by key\n   - Replica lag = eventual consistency (accepted)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Scale + availability (AP)\n   - Reads >> writes: scale Read/Write separately\n   - 500 GB fits one Postgres primary + replicas\n   - Outgrow it? shard by hash(short_code), or a\n     KV store (DynamoDB): every lookup is by key\n   - Replica lag = eventual consistency (accepted)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
